  "description": "Find the maximal network rank of the graph given the number of cities and an array of roads connecting them.",
  "target": 4,
  "pseudocode": "let adj = Array(n).fill(0).map(() => new Set())\nfor (let [u, v] of roads) {\n  adj[u].add(v)\n  adj[v].add(u)\n}\nlet maxRank = 0\nfor (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n  for (let j = i + 1; j < n; j++) {\n    let rank = adj[i].size + adj[j].size - (adj[i].has(j) ? 1 : 0)\n    maxRank = Math.max(maxRank, rank)\n  }\n}",
